# Disaggregated vs. Collocated LLM Serving: An Empirical Systems & Micro-Architectural Study

An end-to-end systems evaluation comparing **Prefill/Decode (P/D) Disaggregated Serving** against **Collocated Serving** using vLLM on dual NVIDIA A100-80GB GPUs across 9 cluster topologies, 279 macro-benchmarks (14,400 requests), and 8 micro-architectural NVIDIA Nsight Systems traces.

