| $16\text{ req/s}$ | Disaggregated (2P:2D) | 3291.4 | 95.8 | 138.3 | 11.56 | 14.90 | Higher queueing latency |

#### Workload B: Enterprise RAG ($8192\text{ in} \times 128\text{ out}$)
| Request Rate ($\lambda$) | Architecture | Realized tok/s | Mean TTFT (ms) | P99 TTFT (ms) | Mean ITL (ms) | P99 ITL (ms) | Operational Regime |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **$1.1\text{ req/s}$** | Collocated (2x TP2) | 137.6 | 146.4 | 535.0 | 8.56 | **9.46** | Un-saturated (quiet intervals) |
| $1.1\text{ req/s}$ | Disaggregated (2P:2D) | 137.9 | 135.2 | **157.4** | 8.47 | 11.23 | Comparable |
| **$3.1\text{ req/s}$** | Collocated (2x TP2) | **374.5** | **69.7** | 229.8 | 8.76 | 19.66 | Chunked prefill absorbing load |
| $3.1\text{ req/s}$ | Disaggregated (2P:2D) | 371.0 | 148.6 | **174.7** | 9.74 | **15.94** | Disagg begins improving tail ITL |
